# Recurring example names and words of the Tatoeba corpus. They are far more
# frequent there than in real text, so the generators (find-supplement.py,
# find-boosts.py, count-pairs.py) leave them out.
Sami
Layla
Mennad
Ziri
Yanni
Skura
Rima
Baya
Fadil
Nuja
Walid
Farid
Taninna
Muiriel
Tom
Mary
Boston
Maria
costruire
nazionalità
# Tatoeba's constructed languages (toki pona).
toki
# Old spellings from public-domain books in Common Voice: paa is the
# typed form of på (da/nb rules), maistre is Middle French.
paa
gøede
maistre
# Profanity: the AOSP lists flag it (f=0: valid, never suggested), the
# generated lists can't.
carajo
cojones
puta
# Finnish case endings written after a colon (TV:ssä, 120:ssa), which the
# word counts split off, and a squared x.
ssa
ssä
sta
stä
lla
llä
lle
x²
# Tatoeba talks about its own languages (Toki Pona, Lojban, Kabyle)
pona
lojban
cabilo
cabylo
